{"availability":"available","full":"jquery-ui-bootstrap/jquery-ui-bootstrap","name":"jquery-ui-bootstrap","description":"A jQuery UI theme based on Twitter Bootstrap","category":"Other","language":"HTML","stars":5462,"forks":782,"created":"2011-12-08T10:49:16Z","updated":"2018-06-18T08:06:30Z","branch":"masterbs3","homepage":"http://jquery-ui-bootstrap.github.io/jquery-ui-bootstrap/","topics":[],"demo":"http://jquery-ui-bootstrap.github.io/jquery-ui-bootstrap/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T13:03:41.282Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T13:03:41.282Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T13:03:41.282Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T13:03:41.282Z","stars":5462,"forks":782}],"technologies":["Node.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This project was started to bring the beauty and ease-of-use of Bootstrap to jQuery UI widgets ♥.","Bootstrap is one of our favorite projects, but having used it regularly it left us wanting two things:","To clarify, this project doesn't aim or intend to replace Bootstrap. It merely provides a jQuery UI-compatible theme inspired by Bootstrap's design. It also provides a version of Bootstrap CSS with a few (minor) sections commented out which enable the theme to work alongside it."],"features":["The ability to work side-by-side with jQuery UI (something which caused a number of widgets to break visually)","The ability to theme jQuery UI widgets using Bootstrap styles. Whilst we love jQuery UI, we find some of the current themes to look a little dated. Our hope is that this theme provides a decent alternative for others…","Lead Product Developer : Addy Osmani","Chief Maintainer : Gerits Aurelien"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jquery-ui-bootstrap/jquery-ui-bootstrap/blob/masterbs3/README.md","fingerprint":"eceda2f1e83ab7be47277683745c3465bc879f9fd0534307a2cdbd340ad8014e","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T13:03:41.341Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T13:03:41.341Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItD